			"notes": "Holy cow its a mod!\nWith multi-version support too? (not great but still)\n\nAnyways I redid the plugin almost from the ground up.  I did more research on the earlier seasons of infuse.  Turns out they never had a deathban mechanic or an \"enhancer\".  Those were from the datapack I originally modeled this plugin after.\n\nNow, we have the ACTUAL \"Infuse Effect\", the good potion.  It's also got the actual recipe too.\n\nAs for other changes, you can now drain your positive effects with /drain to store them or give to others who don't have the effect.  If you have any negative effects, these potions will remove one at random.\n\nYou won't see many other changes from that.\n\nSupports 26.1.1 and above."
		}
